The fifth quest
The fifth and last quest, surprisingly is very easy. Receive it from story mode, go to crystal city, enter the tower and hammer your way across all the enemies. Clime through the floors until you reach the last one. Defeat the unseelers leader there and move to finish the quest. When you complete it you'll get a wand, some aura, and the satisfaction that you have beaten the best the entire game has to offer and have come out on top!